    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……が、一番かわいいに
決まってるよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...But that's obviously the cutest!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11384</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふん！
……の可憐さが理解できないとは
お子様すぎて哀れだな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmph! You are clearly too childish to comprehend true cuteness... I pity you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11652</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>双方とも否定。
容姿および健気さ的に
最も優れているのは……だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You are both incorrect. The most aesthetic and endearing choice is...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12972</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何、騒いでんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What're we fightin' over, boys?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13096</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それが、一番かわいいのを
決めようとしたんだけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're trying to decide which is the cutest...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13220</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>みんな自分の好みばかり
主張して、まとまらないのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>However, everyone only insists on their own personal taste, and we've been unable to reach a consensus.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13344</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>丁度いい。&lt;Hisui&gt;の
意見を聞こう。おそらく
自分と同じ意見のはずだが</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is ideal. Let us hear &lt;Hisui&gt;'s opinion. He will most likely agree with me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13672</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんなはずないさ！
オレと同じじゃなきゃ
おかしいよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No way! He's gonna side with me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14000</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……お、お前ら
誰が一番かわいいかで
もめてんのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...S-So you're fightin' over who's cutest?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Shing&gt;は&lt;Kohaku&gt;派で
&lt;Kunzite&gt;はリチア派だよな？
カルセドニーはマリンさん押しか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, &lt;Shing&gt;'s probably picked &lt;Kohaku&gt;, &lt;Kunzite&gt; Lithia, and Chalcedony Ms Marine, yeah?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14488</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>くううぅぅ……ッ
俺が思うに…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm, they I pick...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14892</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>一番かわいいのは？
・&lt;Kohaku&gt;が一番かわいい！
・リチアが一番かわいい！
・マリンさんが一番かわいい！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The cutest is...?
・&lt;Kohaku&gt;'s the cutest!
・Lithia's the cutest!
・Miss Marine's the cutest!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15032</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kohaku&gt;が一番かわいいに
決まってんだろーが！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kohaku&gt;'s the cutest, obviously!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>シスコンとののしられようが
ウチの&lt;Kohaku&gt;の
かわいさはガチなんだぁぁぁッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Call me whatever the hell you want, but it don't chance the fact my little baby sister is the cutest in the world!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15652</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>シスコンとののしられようが
ウチの&lt;Kohaku&gt;の
かわいさはガチなんだぁぁぁッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Call me whatever the hell you want, but it don't chance the fact my little baby sister is the cutest in the world!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16448</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>リチアが一番
かわいいんじゃねぇか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Lithia's pretty cute, yeah?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16920</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あのちいせぇ体で試練に
耐える姿が、健気っつーか
守ってやりてぇつーか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She's so small, yet so brave standin' up the all the crap thrown her way, and still she tries to protect me...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17156</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>マリンさんが一番かわいいぜ！
愁いをひめた年上のヒトなんて
サイコーじゃねぇかぁッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ms Marine's the cutest! Ain't there some charm to a more mature woman who keeps all her sorrows inside?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17640</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>マリンさんかわいいよ∀
マリンさん∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ms Marine, you cutie! ∀</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17900</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Hisui&gt;……
何を言ってるのだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Hisui&gt;... what are you talking about?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18024</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレたちは
『イヌ』と……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We were trying to decide between dogs...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18148</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『ネコ』と……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Cats...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18272</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『ブタザルモドキ』の
どれが一番かわいいかを
議論していたのだが？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And Mocking Things, correct?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18636</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>な、なにぃ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>W-Wait, really?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>19280</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なのに&lt;Hisui&gt;ってば
変な勘違いして……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What did YOU think we were talking about...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>19444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>女性の外見に
順位をつけようなどと！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How disrespectful ranking women by appearances!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>19568</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……記録した。
『&lt;Hisui&gt;は一番最低』だと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Successfully recorded: "&lt;Hisui&gt; is despicable".</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>19732</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まぎらわしいんだよ
てめぇらぁぁぁ〜〜〜ッ！！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You've got it all wrong~!!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>22408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ところで
『ブタザルモドキ』ってなんだ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...By the way, the hell is a "Mocking Thing"?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>22532</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>結晶界に存在した
愛らしいペット生物だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They are beloved pets on Quartzia.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>22656</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……時々、火炎を
吐いたりもするが</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...However, they are known to spew flames on occasion.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>22780</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>危ねぇだろ、ブタザルモドキ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Isn't that a fire hazard?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
